{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A <strong>FRANTIC</strong>\u00a0Inventory-Management Auto-Battler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the meaty minds that brought you Hot Dogs, Horseshoes &amp; Hand Grenades, we are proud to present, <strong>Dunderbeck</strong>! That's right, it's <i>another sausage game. </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grind magical creatures into sausages in the mystical world of Cincinnati, Ohio!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So, what do I do in this game? <i>Huh?</i> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/0a096db699009976b8b48651aded7c92.poster.avif?t=1772043169\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/0a096db699009976b8b48651aded7c92.webm?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/0a096db699009976b8b48651aded7c92.mp4?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the portable, all-purpose cooking &amp; crafting machine: Shove in carcasses and random junk; cook up things that might be edible, and cobble together basic tools and weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/1ece23a2779c30e8e63a7739447807f2.poster.avif?t=1772043169\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/1ece23a2779c30e8e63a7739447807f2.webm?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/1ece23a2779c30e8e63a7739447807f2.mp4?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seriously, pick something up and swing. A spoon? Sure. A lead pipe? Why not. A rat? Desperate times, right? Just don't expect your makeshift arsenal to last forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/faa07bea8033b9db80ff6d4c6619491e.poster.avif?t=1772043169\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/faa07bea8033b9db80ff6d4c6619491e.webm?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/faa07bea8033b9db80ff6d4c6619491e.mp4?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, everything is eatable - at least once!  Hold any item in your mouth for too long, and down the hatch it goes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/8975e57fe6c9a038befd04947c0b7f8f.poster.avif?t=1772043169\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/8975e57fe6c9a038befd04947c0b7f8f.webm?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/8975e57fe6c9a038befd04947c0b7f8f.mp4?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like the garbage you keep at home, all of <strong>OUR WONDERFUL GARBAGE</strong> has a size and shape. You can put it into nice little rows, or you can just go full goblin mode. We aren't your mom - do what <i>feels right</i>, you know?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2477750?t=1772043169","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/4a9dc5ed3762620ab22846ee95fa2d40b21f3630/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772043169","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/79e64e7910bd2a3d6f3e21e53933ea8752597888/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772043169","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/79e64e7910bd2a3d6f3e21e53933ea8752597888/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772043169","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Cartoon depiction of dead magical creatures and food products prepared from their remains."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3804770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A <strong>FRANTIC</strong>\u00a0Inventory-Management Auto-Battler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the meaty minds that brought you Hot Dogs, Horseshoes &amp; Hand Grenades, we are proud to present, <strong>Dunderbeck</strong>! That's right, it's <i>another sausage game. </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grind magical creatures into sausages in the mystical world of Cincinnati, Ohio!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So, what do I do in this game? <i>Huh?</i> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/0a096db699009976b8b48651aded7c92.poster.avif?t=1772043169\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/0a096db699009976b8b48651aded7c92.webm?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/0a096db699009976b8b48651aded7c92.mp4?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the portable, all-purpose cooking &amp; crafting machine: Shove in carcasses and random junk; cook up things that might be edible, and cobble together basic tools and weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/1ece23a2779c30e8e63a7739447807f2.poster.avif?t=1772043169\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/1ece23a2779c30e8e63a7739447807f2.webm?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/1ece23a2779c30e8e63a7739447807f2.mp4?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seriously, pick something up and swing. A spoon? Sure. A lead pipe? Why not. A rat? Desperate times, right? Just don't expect your makeshift arsenal to last forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/faa07bea8033b9db80ff6d4c6619491e.poster.avif?t=1772043169\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/faa07bea8033b9db80ff6d4c6619491e.webm?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/faa07bea8033b9db80ff6d4c6619491e.mp4?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, everything is eatable - at least once!  Hold any item in your mouth for too long, and down the hatch it goes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/8975e57fe6c9a038befd04947c0b7f8f.poster.avif?t=1772043169\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/8975e57fe6c9a038befd04947c0b7f8f.webm?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/8975e57fe6c9a038befd04947c0b7f8f.mp4?t=1772043169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like the garbage you keep at home, all of <strong>OUR WONDERFUL GARBAGE</strong> has a size and shape. You can put it into nice little rows, or you can just go full goblin mode. We aren't your mom - do what <i>feels right</i>, you know?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["RUST LTD."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/8d6e050ae260bcc97f492bf89d181630443c2b50/header.jpg?t=1772043169","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 or newer</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 26.2<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Only</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong>